'''Tree Kachirho''' was one of the inhabited [[wroshyr tree]]s that made up the [[Wookiee]] settlement of [[Kachirho]], in the [[Wawaatt Archipelago]] of the [[planet]] [[Kashyyyk]]. The home [[tree]] of [[Chief]]tain [[Tarfful]], it hosted [[Jedi Master|Master]] [[Yoda]]'s command post during the [[Battle of Kashyyyk]].<ref name="CL" />

